# --- assumption audit ---
# The three per-tree probe files assumptions/{model,ssprove,vst}.v are
# intentionally NOT in the default build: ssprove.v is a ~35s serial
# `Print Assumptions` tail on the headline theorem, and vst.v an
# axiom-fetch-heavy compile over the whole VST body-proof surface.
# `make audit` / assumptions/check.sh recompiles each standalone (gate 3),
# so the audit is unaffected; `-Q assumptions Assumptions` above is kept
# so those standalone compiles resolve (and so editor tooling reading
# this file resolves them too).
